<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85647" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πονηρ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bad state</i> or <i>condition,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Mi.</u>
					374d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ σώματος π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					609c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ψυχῆς</span> ibid.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in moral sense,
				<i>wickedness, vice, knavery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ μωρία . . ἀδελφὴ τῆς π. ἔφυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					925
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				868
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				22.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν π. πάλιν
			τρέπεται</span> turns again to <i>vice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				7.5.75
			</span></i>: in pl., <i>knavish tricks, rogueries,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1389a18
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>baseness, cowardice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				645
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				14.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> with a
			political connotation, <i>mob-rule,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				8.47
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
